sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Lib as Incident library
    participant Sim as Simulator
    participant Eng as Engineer on call
    participant Env as Practice environment
    participant Sc as Scoring
    Eng->>Sim: start a drill
    Sim->>Lib: pick a past incident
    Sim->>Env: replay the telemetry from that day
    Env-->>Eng: dashboards and alerts as they actually looked
    loop until resolved or time runs out
        Eng->>Env: run a diagnostic
        Env-->>Eng: the response recorded at that step
        Eng->>Sim: state a hypothesis
    end
    Sim->>Sc: compare against the real timeline
    Sc-->>Eng: where the path diverged, and what the responders did
    Note over Sc: the score is time-to-correct-hypothesis, not time-to-fix
